##########################################################################
Two passages in src/utils/, applied by citools/patches/patch_tqmesh.cmake, where they are also
explained in full: ASSERT/assert_msg and TERMINATE throw instead of calling assert(), doing nothing
at all in a release build, or exiting the process - none of which is acceptable inside a python
session - and the ASSERT in ~QuadTree() becomes a plain null check, since throwing from a destructor
would call std::terminate. Nothing else is touched.

